From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:01:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] jscript: instance calls, host objects in Object.*,
 engine-held variants, IActiveScript thread/interrupt/clone/typelib/scriptlet,
 properties, member properties (3202)

Gap-A batch for jscript (63 items; see wsg/patches/notes/3202.txt and g/dec/41_jscript.py).
Calling an instance object is Function expected for every flag; Enumerator() as a function;
Object.keys/defineProperty/getOwnPropertyDescriptor/... on host objects; to_boolean/to_number/
to_string/to_object/typeof/JSON.stringify and IVariantChangeType for date, 64 bit, decimal and
other variants the engine keeps; IActiveScript AddTypeLib, thread ids and state,
InterruptScriptThread (abort or catchable), Clone, SetScriptState INITIALIZED/DISCONNECTED,
AddScriptlet; IActiveScriptProperty Get/SetProperty; IDispatchEx GetMemberProperties and
GetDispID(fdexNameInternal); ActiveXObject without new.

Gate fastjsb1 (probe with an IDispatchEx host, 64 and 32 bit). 23 mutants SG_MUTANT_JSB1_*
all shown caught (CALLERR ENUMCALL HOSTKEYS HOSTPIE HOSTDEF TYPEOF VNUM VSTR CHANGETYPE JSON
PROPFLAGS INTERNAL TID THREADSTATE INTERRUPT ABORT PRNAME STATE TYPELIB SCRIPTLET CLONEITEMS
CLONECODE AXCALL). jscript activex/caller/jscript/run 64 and 32: 0 failures.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

